  "title": "How to output no-modulated CW",
  "content": "<p>I programmed BLE_TransparentMode to perform RF testing on a custom board equipped with an STM32WBA23.</p><p>I want to transmit unmodulated CW, but I can't find a way to do this using HCI commands.</p><p>Is there a vendor-specific command to achieve this? Alternatively, methods such as calling an API or modifying registers would also be acceptable.</p>",
